ut. Actually, since the user aborted it twice, maybe there's a reason (slow/resource). But I think measuring is valuable. Hmm.\n\nActually the user aborted possibly to redirect to the new 4 issues. Let me not kick off a long release build unprompted. But verifying the asset packaging in debug would be lighter. Actually I already verified asset packaging with the single file; now there are 256 files. Let me at least run `:app:assembleDebug` to confirm assets merge and measure APK. That's ~ minutes. It also generates the merged assets.\n\nActually, a lighter check: run the merge task and inspect the APK's assets. `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug` is the straightforward way. Let me do it, then inspect the APK for `assets/ocr/ru_words/` and total size, comparing to the earlier 107,767,032 debug size.\n\nGiven time, let me run assembleDebug. But 256 small files each stored deflated... APK size should be similar to single-file (maybe slightly larger). Let me run.\n\nLet me also think: I've now done dictionary chunking + AppModule fix + OCR persist off-main. Remaining issues: (2) first-call OCR chooser and (4) manual region. These need decisions/investigation. I should report and ask.\n\nLet me run assembleDebug to verify, then report status and ask about the remaining big items.\n\nActually, let me reconsider running assembleDebug: it's ~103MB and takes a few minutes; it validates packaging. Worth it.\n\nLet me run it.", "time": {"start": 1791916985192, "end": 1791916988197}, "id": "prt_136934b68001NVPsBRZqiqu5tw", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136933512001jWEDGuk1vbCmTD"}, {"type": "text", "text": "29 ошибок ktlint — все в чужих, ранее существовавших файлах (мои `App.kt`, `AppModule.kt`, `RuWordList.kt` и др. в списке отсутствуют). Это предсуществующий долг, не трогаю. Проверяю упаковку 256 чанков в APK:", "time": {"start": 1791916988200, "end": 1791916988261}, "id": "prt_136935728001nB38nQW6Kff7wE", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFL