 "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e2.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e3.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e4.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e5.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e6.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e7.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e8.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/e9.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/ea.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/eb.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/ec.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/ed.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/ee.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/ef.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f0.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f1.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f2.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f3.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f4.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f5.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f6.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f7.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f8.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/f9.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/fa.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/fb.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/fc.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/fd.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/fe.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/ff.txt", "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/assets/ocr/ru_words/index.txt"], "id": "prt_1369a2f61001nnx6syZgj7HT61", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136994092001h8jBpjRqdnG5oT"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_136851e9f001vbQSM6Hp2bsA9j", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 62940, "input": 2388, "output": 1747, "reasoning": 821, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 57984}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791917438586, "completed": 1791917488073}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "98430fbf31cd74f188ff9b9a9af47095c8b1417a", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1369a4951001phHiFmmEaOJs5h", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Excellent! Contiguous chunks: zlib9 sum ~8.36 MB (even better than the single-file's 11.3MB APK figure, though APK uses a different deflate setting; estimate is optimistic). Anyway, localization preserved. Great.\n\nNow update RuWordList to load index + contiguous chunks.\n\nLet me rewrite RuWordList.kt.\n\nDesign:\n- SHARD_DIR = \"ocr/ru_words\"\n- INDEX = \"index.txt\"\n- boundaries: lazy Array<String>, thread-safe.\n- cache: HashMap<Int, Set<String>>.\n- contains(word): if empty false; boundaries = boundaries(); if null/empty false; idx = floor; chunkWords(idx).contains(word).\n- floorIndex compares natural strings.\n\nThread-safety for boundaries: use a lock or @Volatile + synchronized. Let me use a dedicated `boundariesLock` or reuse `lock`.\n\nLet me write:\n\n```kotlin\nobject RuWordList {\n    private const val SHARD_DIR = \"ocr/ru_words\"\n    private const val INDEX_NAME = \"index.txt\"\n\n    private val TEST_DIR_CANDIDATES = listOf(...)\n    @Volatile private var opener: ((String) -> InputStream)? = null\n    private val lock = Any()\n    private val cache = HashMap<Int, Set<String>>()\n    @Volatile private var boundaries: Array<String>? = null\n\n    fun configure(context: Context) { opener = { name -> context.assets.open(\"$SHARD_DIR/$name\") } }\n\n    fun contains(word: String): Boolean {\n        if (word.isEmpty()) return false\n        val bounds = boundaries() ?: return false\n        val idx = floorIndex(bounds, word)\n        if (idx < 0) return false\n        return shardWords(idx).contains(word)\n    }\n\n    private fun floorIndex(bounds: Array<String>, word: String): Int {\n        var lo = 0; var hi = bounds.size - 1; var ans = -1\n        while (lo <= hi) {\n            val mid = (lo + hi) ushr 1\n            if (bounds[mid] <= word) { ans = mid; lo = mid + 1 } else hi = mid - 1\n        }\n        return ans\n    }\n\n    private fun boundaries(): Array<String>? {\n        boundaries?.let { return it }\n        synchronized(lock) {\n            boundaries?.let { return it }\n            val loaded = loadBoundaries()\n            boundaries = loaded\n            return loaded\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun loadBoundaries(): Array<String>? {\n        val stream = openShard(INDEX_NAME) ?: run { warn; return null }\n        val list = ArrayList<String>(shardCount)\n        stream.bufferedReader(Charsets.UTF_8).use { r -> while(true){ val line=r.readLine()?:break; if(line.isNotEmpty()) list.add(line) } }\n        if (list.isEmpty()) return null\n        return list.toTypedArray()\n    }\n    ...\n}\n```\n\nHmm, `warn` logging. Fine.\n\nshardWords(idx): name = \"%02x.txt\".format(idx). Since chunks are numbered 0..255 in order.\n\nNote: `String <= String` in Kotlin uses compareTo; `bounds[mid] <= word` works.\n\nEdge: a word smaller than boundaries[0] → ans=-1 → false (correct, since boundaries[0]=\"А\" and nothing sorts below \"А\" except maybe \"-\" words; actually there could be words starting with \"-\"? is_wordform rejects startswith(\"-\"). So \"А\" is the min. Good. But what about words with digits/latin looked up at runtime (e.g., user token \"ABC\")? floorIndex might return -1 or some chunk; then HashSet contains false. Fine.\n\nLet me rewrite the file.\n\nAlso update the KDoc: describe contiguous chunks + index.\n\nLet me write it.", "time": {"start": 1791917443542, "end": 1791917448209}, "id": "prt_1369a49d60015pU7WaVY0xGX9Q", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Отлично — непрерывные чанки дают ~8.4 МБ (локальность deflate сохранена). Переписываю загрузчик под индекс границ:", "time": {"start": 1791917448219, "end": 1791917456102}, "id": "prt_1369a5c1b001Vd3VfbzNtyf4hF", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "write", "callID": "call_00_2hpknw4m9wc9zzz8d1ucsknr", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"content": "package mihon.data.ocr\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport java.io.File\nimport java.io.InputStream\nimport logcat.LogPriority\nimport tachiyomi.core.common.util.system.logcat\n\n/**\n * Частотный словарь русских словоформ для разбиения слипшегося OCR-текста\n * на слова (только вставка пробелов, без замены символов — словарная\n * «коррекция» запрещена правилами проекта).\n *\n * Источники (пересборка — `scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py`):\n *  * морфологический лексикон OpenCorpora;\n *  * ё/е-варианты каждой формы: OCR читает ё непоследовательно, и «НАМЁКА»\n *    обязано находиться так же, как «НАМЕКА»;\n *  * литературная лексика из прежней версии словаря (её в субтитрах нет);\n *  * сиды device-регрессий и однобуквенные служебные слова.\n *\n * 3 млн форм раскладываются по 256 чанкам-ассетам `assets/ocr/ru_words/NN.txt`\n * (NN — номер непрерывного диапазона отсортированного словаря) плюс индекс\n * `index.txt` с первой формой каждого чанка. Раньше формы были зашиты\n * строковыми литералами в RuWordListPartNNN.kt: 3 млн форм раздували APK на\n * ~65 МБ (DEX), и установка падала с `Failed to allocate … because only …\n * allocatable` (ENOSPC) на телефонах с малым запасом свободного места.\n *\n * Чанки грузятся ЛЕНИВО и по одному: поиск слова идёт бинарным поиском по\n * границам (256 строк), затем читается только его чанк (~12 тыс. форм), а не\n * весь словарь. Сплошной `HashSet` на 3 млн требовал единовременной аллокации\n * сотен мегабайт и подвешивал телефон на первом же OCR. Непрерывные\n * (а не хеш-) чанки выбраны специально: соседние формы делят длинные префиксы,\n * и deflate в APK сжимает их почти так же плотно, как единый файл.\n */\nobject RuWordList {\n\n    private const val SHARD_DIR = \"ocr/ru_words\"\n\n    /** Индекс: одна граничная форма на строку, по одной на чанк, по порядку. */\n    private const val INDEX_NAME = \"index.txt\"\n\n    /**\n     * Куда смотреть в JVM-юнит-тестах, где нет AssetManager. Gradle запускает\n     * тесты с рабочим каталогом = каталог модуля `data`, поэтому первый путь\n     * ведёт к тем же файлам, что упакованы в APK.\n     */\n    private val TEST_DIR_CANDIDATES = listOf(\n        \"src/main/assets/$SHARD_DIR\",\n        \"data/src/main/assets/$SHARD_DIR\",\n    )\n\n    @Volatile\n    private var opener: ((String) -> InputStream)? = null\n\n    private val lock = Any()\n    private val cache = HashMap<Int, Set<String>>()\n\n    @Volatile\n    private var index: Array<String>? = null\n\n    /**\n     * Привязывает словарь к ассетам приложения и вызывается на старте (`App`)\n     * до первого обращения к [contains]. Без вызова доступен только тестовый\n     * источник из исходников модуля.\n     */\n    fun configure(context: Context) {\n        opener = { name -> context.assets.open(\"$SHARD_DIR/$name\") }\n    }\n\n    /** Правда, если ПРОПИСНАЯ словоформа есть во встроенном словаре. */\n    fun contains(word: String): Boolean {\n        if (word.isEmpty()) return false\n        val bounds = boundaries() ?: return false\n        val chunk = floorChunk(bounds, word)\n        if (chunk < 0) return false\n        return chunkWords(chunk).contains(word)\n    }\n\n    /** Номер последнего чанка, чья граница не больше [word] (или -1). */\n    private fun floorChunk(bounds: Array<String>, word: String): Int {\n        var lo = 0\n        var hi = bounds.size - 1\n        var ans = -1\n        while (lo <= hi) {\n            val mid = (lo + hi) ushr 1\n            if (bounds[mid] <= word) {\n                ans = mid\n                lo = mid + 1\n            } else {\n                hi = mid - 1\n            }\n        }\n        return ans\n    }\n\n    private fun boundaries(): Array<String>? {\n        index?.let { return it }\n        synchronized(lock) {\n            index?.let { return it }\n            val loaded = loadIndex()\n            index = loaded\n            return loaded\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun loadIndex(): Array<String>? {\n        val stream = openShard(INDEX_NAME)\n        if (stream == null) {\n            logcat(LogPriority.WARN) {\n                \"RuWordList: индекс $SHARD_DIR/$INDEX_NAME не найден — разбиение капса деградирует\"\n            }\n            return null\n        }\n        val list = ArrayList<String>()\n        stream.bufferedReader(Charsets.UTF_8).use { reader ->\n            while (true) {\n                val line = reader.readLine() ?: break\n                if (line.isNotEmpty()) list.add(line)\n            }\n        }\n        return list.takeIf { it.isNotEmpty() }?.toTypedArray()\n    }\n\n    private fun chunkWords(chunk: Int): Set<String> {\n        synchronized(lock) { cache[chunk]?.let { return it } }\n        // Читаем вне блокировки: диск/ассет не держим под общим локом.\n        val words = loadChunk(\"%02x.txt\".format(chunk))\n        synchronized(lock) {\n            cache[chunk]?.let { return it }\n            cache[chunk] = words\n            return words\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun loadChunk(name: String): Set<String> {\n        val stream = openShard(name)\n        if (stream == null) {\n            logcat(LogPriority.WARN) {\n                \"RuWordList: чанк $SHARD_DIR/$name не найден — разбиение капса деградирует\"\n            }\n            return emptySet()\n        }\n        // Формы в файле уже прописные: вставляем как есть, без uppercase().\n        val set = HashSet<String>()\n        stream.bufferedReader(Charsets.UTF_8).use { reader ->\n            while (true) {\n                val line = reader.readLine() ?: break\n                if (line.isNotEmpty()) set.add(line)\n            }\n        }\n        return set\n    }\n\n    private fun openShard(name: String): InputStream? {\n        opener?.let { return it(name) }\n        for (dir in TEST_DIR_CANDIDATES) {\n            val file = File(dir, name)\n            if (file.isFile) return file.inputStream()\n        }\n        return null\n    }\n}\n", "filePath": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/java/mihon/data/ocr/RuWordList.kt"}, "output": "Wrote file successfully.", "metadata": {"diagnostics": {}, "filepath": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/java/mihon/data/ocr/RuWordList.kt", "exists": true, "truncated": false}, "title": "data/src/main/java/mihon/data/ocr/RuWordList.kt", "time": {"start": 1791917456075, "end": 1791917456126}}, "id": "prt_1369a5cfe0017b3JyADFe5FMOP", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "8d8525331e7d316a3a98835d0015ee0205319a1c", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 62940, "input": 2388, "output": 1747, "reasoning": 821, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 57984}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1369af6d9001J310apk6nKLUV6", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU"}, {"type": "patch", "hash": "98430fbf31cd74f188ff9b9a9af47095c8b1417a", "files": ["/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/data/src/main/java/mihon/data/ocr/RuWordList.kt"], "id": "prt_1369af7c20011DRNtw0saYW1OC", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369a367a0013DXSbzp2mrzJIU"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_136851e9f001vbQSM6Hp2bsA9j", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 64032, "input": 2668, "output": 1046, "reasoning": 30, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 60288}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791917491025, "completed": 1791917522069}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "8d8525331e7d316a3a98835d0015ee0205319a1c", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1369b1ba3001nYMhCe4WBuD25t", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Now update the generator to produce contiguous chunks + index instead of hash shards.\n\nLet me rewrite `shard_of` and `write_shards`.", "time": {"start": 1791917497258, "end": 1791917497409}, "id": "prt_1369b1baa0012TfRvskAmBmF1R", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Обновляю генератор под непрерывные чанки + индекс:", "time": {"start": 1791917497421, "end": 1791917505637}, "id": "prt_1369b1c4d0011GcSnxhs4sf9hh", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "edit", "callID": "call_00_goyd80ma5zu0oi4j7tb60ois", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"filePath": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py", "newString": "def write_shards(repo, forms):\n    \"\"\"Раскладывает ПРОПИСНЫЕ формы по непрерывным чанкам assets/ocr/ru_words/.\n\n    Чанки — это подряд идущие диапазоны ОТСОРТИРОВАННОГО словаря, а не\n    хеш-бакеты: соседние формы делят длинные префиксы, и deflate в APK сжимает\n    такие чанки почти так же плотно, как единый файл (хеш-шардирование теряло\n    ~половину экономии). Рядом кладётся index.txt — первая форма каждого чанка;\n    [RuWordList] бинарным поиском по нему выбирает нужный чанк, поэтому грузит\n    только ~12 тыс. форм, а не весь словарь. Прописной регистр — чтобы\n    [RuWordList] вставлял строки как есть, без uppercase() на 3 млн элементов.\n    \"\"\"\n    out_dir = os.path.join(repo, SHARD_DIR_REL)\n    os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n    for name in os.listdir(out_dir):\n        if name.endswith(\".txt\"):\n            os.remove(os.path.join(out_dir, name))\n\n    upper = [word.upper() for word in forms]\n    chunk_size = (len(upper) + SHARD_COUNT - 1) // SHARD_COUNT\n    boundaries = []\n    for shard in range(SHARD_COUNT):\n        part = upper[shard * chunk_size:(shard + 1) * chunk_size]\n        if not part:\n            break\n        boundaries.append(part[0])\n        with open(os.path.join(out_dir, f\"{shard:02x}.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n            handle.write(\"\\n\".join(part) + \"\\n\")\n    with open(os.path.join(out_dir, \"index.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n        handle.write(\"\\n\".join(boundaries) + \"\\n\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    lexicon_path, repo = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]\n    forms = build(lexicon_path, repo)\n    write_shards(repo, forms)\n    print(f\"форм: {len(forms)}, чанки: {SHARD_DIR_REL}/\")", "oldString": "def shard_of(word):\n    \"\"\"Младший байт Java-`String.hashCode()` — тот же хеш считает [RuWordList].\"\"\"\n    h = 0\n    for ch in word:\n        h = (h * 31 + ord(ch)) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n    return h & (SHARD_COUNT - 1)\n\n\ndef write_shards(repo, forms):\n    \"\"\"Раскладывает ПРОПИСНЫЕ формы по чанкам assets/ocr/ru_words/NN.txt.\n\n    Прописной регистр — чтобы [RuWordList] вставлял строки как есть, без\n    uppercase() на каждый из 3 млн элементов. Шардирование по `hashCode()`\n    даёт равномерные куски (~12 тыс. форм), которые грузятся по одному.\n    \"\"\"\n    out_dir = os.path.join(repo, SHARD_DIR_REL)\n    os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n    for name in os.listdir(out_dir):\n        if name.endswith(\".txt\"):\n            os.remove(os.path.join(out_dir, name))\n\n    shards = {}\n    for word in forms:\n        up = word.upper()\n        shards.setdefault(shard_of(up), []).append(up)\n    for shard, words in shards.items():\n        with open(os.path.join(out_dir, f\"{shard:02x}.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n            for word in sorted(words):\n                handle.write(word + \"\\n\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    lexicon_path, repo = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]\n    forms = build(lexicon_path, repo)\n    write_shards(repo, forms)\n    print(f\"форм: {len(forms)}, чанки: {SHARD_DIR_REL}/\")"}, "output": "Edit applied successfully.", "metadata": {"diagnostics": {}, "diff": "Index: /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py\n===================================================================\n--- /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py\n+++ /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py\n@@ -114,37 +114,37 @@\n     forms = {f.replace(\"ё\", \"е\") for f in forms if f}\n     return sorted(forms)\n \n \n-def shard_of(word):\n-    \"\"\"Младший байт Java-`String.hashCode()` — тот же хеш считает [RuWordList].\"\"\"\n-    h = 0\n-    for ch in word:\n-        h = (h * 31 + ord(ch)) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n-    return h & (SHARD_COUNT - 1)\n-\n-\n def write_shards(repo, forms):\n-    \"\"\"Раскладывает ПРОПИСНЫЕ формы по чанкам assets/ocr/ru_words/NN.txt.\n+    \"\"\"Раскладывает ПРОПИСНЫЕ формы по непрерывным чанкам assets/ocr/ru_words/.\n \n-    Прописной регистр — чтобы [RuWordList] вставлял строки как есть, без\n-    uppercase() на каждый из 3 млн элементов. Шардирование по `hashCode()`\n-    даёт равномерные куски (~12 тыс. форм), которые грузятся по одному.\n+    Чанки — это подряд идущие диапазоны ОТСОРТИРОВАННОГО словаря, а не\n+    хеш-бакеты: соседние формы делят длинные префиксы, и deflate в APK сжимает\n+    такие чанки почти так же плотно, как единый файл (хеш-шардирование теряло\n+    ~половину экономии). Рядом кладётся index.txt — первая форма каждого чанка;\n+    [RuWordList] бинарным поиском по нему выбирает нужный чанк, поэтому грузит\n+    только ~12 тыс. форм, а не весь словарь. Прописной регистр — чтобы\n+    [RuWordList] вставлял строки как есть, без uppercase() на 3 млн элементов.\n     \"\"\"\n     out_dir = os.path.join(repo, SHARD_DIR_REL)\n     os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n     for name in os.listdir(out_dir):\n         if name.endswith(\".txt\"):\n             os.remove(os.path.join(out_dir, name))\n \n-    shards = {}\n-    for word in forms:\n-        up = word.upper()\n-        shards.setdefault(shard_of(up), []).append(up)\n-    for shard, words in shards.items():\n+    upper = [word.upper() for word in forms]\n+    chunk_size = (len(upper) + SHARD_COUNT - 1) // SHARD_COUNT\n+    boundaries = []\n+    for shard in range(SHARD_COUNT):\n+        part = upper[shard * chunk_size:(shard + 1) * chunk_size]\n+        if not part:\n+            break\n+        boundaries.append(part[0])\n         with open(os.path.join(out_dir, f\"{shard:02x}.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n-            for word in sorted(words):\n-                handle.write(word + \"\\n\")\n+            handle.write(\"\\n\".join(part) + \"\\n\")\n+    with open(os.path.join(out_dir, \"index.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n+        handle.write(\"\\n\".join(boundaries) + \"\\n\")\n \n \n def main():\n     lexicon_path, repo = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]\n", "filediff": {"file": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py", "patch": "Index: /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py\n===================================================================\n--- /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py\n+++ /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py\n@@ -114,37 +114,37 @@\n     forms = {f.replace(\"ё\", \"е\") for f in forms if f}\n     return sorted(forms)\n \n \n-def shard_of(word):\n-    \"\"\"Младший байт Java-`String.hashCode()` — тот же хеш считает [RuWordList].\"\"\"\n-    h = 0\n-    for ch in word:\n-        h = (h * 31 + ord(ch)) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n-    return h & (SHARD_COUNT - 1)\n-\n-\n def write_shards(repo, forms):\n-    \"\"\"Раскладывает ПРОПИСНЫЕ формы по чанкам assets/ocr/ru_words/NN.txt.\n+    \"\"\"Раскладывает ПРОПИСНЫЕ формы по непрерывным чанкам assets/ocr/ru_words/.\n \n-    Прописной регистр — чтобы [RuWordList] вставлял строки как есть, без\n-    uppercase() на каждый из 3 млн элементов. Шардирование по `hashCode()`\n-    даёт равномерные куски (~12 тыс. форм), которые грузятся по одному.\n+    Чанки — это подряд идущие диапазоны ОТСОРТИРОВАННОГО словаря, а не\n+    хеш-бакеты: соседние формы делят длинные префиксы, и deflate в APK сжимает\n+    такие чанки почти так же плотно, как единый файл (хеш-шардирование теряло\n+    ~половину экономии). Рядом кладётся index.txt — первая форма каждого чанка;\n+    [RuWordList] бинарным поиском по нему выбирает нужный чанк, поэтому грузит\n+    только ~12 тыс. форм, а не весь словарь. Прописной регистр — чтобы\n+    [RuWordList] вставлял строки как есть, без uppercase() на 3 млн элементов.\n     \"\"\"\n     out_dir = os.path.join(repo, SHARD_DIR_REL)\n     os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n     for name in os.listdir(out_dir):\n         if name.endswith(\".txt\"):\n             os.remove(os.path.join(out_dir, name))\n \n-    shards = {}\n-    for word in forms:\n-        up = word.upper()\n-        shards.setdefault(shard_of(up), []).append(up)\n-    for shard, words in shards.items():\n+    upper = [word.upper() for word in forms]\n+    chunk_size = (len(upper) + SHARD_COUNT - 1) // SHARD_COUNT\n+    boundaries = []\n+    for shard in range(SHARD_COUNT):\n+        part = upper[shard * chunk_size:(shard + 1) * chunk_size]\n+        if not part:\n+            break\n+        boundaries.append(part[0])\n         with open(os.path.join(out_dir, f\"{shard:02x}.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n-            for word in sorted(words):\n-                handle.write(word + \"\\n\")\n+            handle.write(\"\\n\".join(part) + \"\\n\")\n+    with open(os.path.join(out_dir, \"index.txt\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as handle:\n+        handle.write(\"\\n\".join(boundaries) + \"\\n\")\n \n \n def main():\n     lexicon_path, repo = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]\n", "additions": 19, "deletions": 19}, "truncated": false}, "title": "scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py", "time": {"start": 1791917505632, "end": 1791917505685}}, "id": "prt_1369b1ccf001A82wgSbutluFc2", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 64032, "input": 2668, "output": 1046, "reasoning": 30, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 60288}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1369b7bc2001jbLic75xPZjQt4", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef"}, {"type": "patch", "hash": "8d8525331e7d316a3a98835d0015ee0205319a1c", "files": ["/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/scripts/gen_ruwordlist.py"], "id": "prt_1369b7c8b001sz6o8WXV6FThlg", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b0351001b9CY33wifjlLef"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_136851e9f001vbQSM6Hp2bsA9j", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 64385, "input": 1199, "output": 97, "reasoning": 241, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 62848}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791917525877, "completed": 1791917575317}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1369b8b75001OEY0XemOrRHtCL", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1369ba012001OvNlHZRns6xLdX", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b8b75001OEY0XemOrRHtCL"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Wait — the generator's `main()` expects `forms` sorted ascending. `build()` returns `sorted(forms)`, good. And `write_shards` now assumes `forms` is sorted (for contiguous ranges). Yes, `build()` returns `sorted(...)`. Good.\n\nBut there's a subtle issue: the boundary comparison in Kotlin uses UTF-16 code unit order, and Python `sorted()` uses code point order. Same for BMP. The chunk boundaries are `part[0]` = first word of each contiguous range. Sorted ascending. Good.\n\nNow, I regenerated the chunks with my one-off script from the union of old hash shards. The generator would produce the same given the same forms. Good. But the one-off did `words = sorted(set(words))` where words were already uppercase. Uppercase Cyrillic sort order == lowercase sort order? For Cyrillic, yes, case doesn't change order. And the boundary comparison against uppercase lookup words is consistent. Good.\n\nNow rerun tests (data OCR tests) to make sure the new loader works with the index.\n\nThen rebuild debug to measure compression.\n\nLet me run tests.", "time": {"start": 1791917531228, "end": 1791917532979}, "id": "prt_1369ba05c001ESh1jcYDAuYsMH", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b8b75001OEY0XemOrRHtCL"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_00_jgmipwbe03hiwyby9x54s0s2", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && ./gradlew :data:testDebugUnitTest --tests \"mihon.data.ocr.*\" 2>&1 | tail -6", "timeout": 900000}, "output": "\nFor more on this, please refer to https://docs.gradle.org/9.6.1/userguide/command_line_interface.html#sec:command_line_warnings in the Gradle documentation.\n\nBUILD SUCCESSFUL in 40s\n68 actionable tasks: 7 executed, 61 up-to-date\nConfiguration cache entry stored.\n", "metadata": {"output": "\nFor more on this, please refer to https://docs.gradle.org/9.6.1/userguide/command_line_interface.html#sec:command_line_warnings in the Gradle documentation.\n\nBUILD SUCCESSFUL in 40s\n68 actionable tasks: 7 executed, 61 up-to-date\nConfiguration cache entry stored.\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && ./gradlew :data:testDebugUnitTest --tests \"mihon.data.ocr.*\" 2>&1 | tail -6", "time": {"start": 1791917533386, "end": 1791917574540}}, "id": "prt_1369ba7d5001Cg1ygM75skBQfP", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b8b75001OEY0XemOrRHtCL"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 64385, "input": 1199, "output": 97, "reasoning": 241, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 62848}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1369c4b35001bAjc8KLwghpEYt", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369b8b75001OEY0XemOrRHtCL"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_136851e9f001vbQSM6Hp2bsA9j", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 64886, "input": 470, "output": 205, "reasoning": 211, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 64000}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791917579473, "completed": 1791918241309}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1369c5cd1001aTFUPBs0D80bUl", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1369c6fba001heXwqtxwHs9PCM", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369c5cd1001aTFUPBs0D80bUl"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Tests pass. Now rebuild debug to measure APK size and shard compression. This is ~5 min but important. Let me run assembleDebug and then inspect.\n\nActually, I already know the zlib estimate ~8.4MB. But the APK uses different deflate. Let me just verify with a quick zip measurement without full rebuild: create a zip of the new assets dir with the same method. Actually simplest: `cd data/src/main/assets/ocr && zip -9 -r /tmp/x.zip ru_words` and check size. That approximates. But APK compression in AGP may be lower level. Let me just do the zip test to confirm the locality fix (should be ~8-12MB, not 22MB).\n\nLet me do the quick zip test rather than a 5-min rebuild. Then decide whether to do the full release build.\n\nActually the important deliverable is the release APK size. The user will likely want that. But release build takes long. Let me first do the cheap verification.", "time": {"start": 1791917584320, "end": 1791917589654}, "id": "prt_1369c6fc0001Z6U1TMLkvmgx5s", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369c5cd1001aTFUPBs0D80bUl"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Тесты зелёные. Быстрая проверка сжатия без полной сборки:", "time": {"start": 1791917589672, "end": 1791917590040}, "id": "prt_1369c84a8001z8lCpZ7KRDvdXX", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1369c5cd1001aTFUPBs0D80bUl"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_00_atdydqz