"write": 0, "read": 64384}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791918243284, "completed": 1791918275779}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_136a67dd4001yYz75zx8L1WvEc", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_136a69836001HU92ml9U6mbuhz", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a67dd4001yYz75zx8L1WvEc"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "~8.78 MB compressed for shards+index vs 11.34 MB single file. Even better than the single file! Great — locality preserved and per-file overhead negligible. So the chunked dictionary is actually SMALLER in APK than the single file (8.78 vs 11.34). \n\nNow let me rebuild debug to confirm actual APK packaging and size. Actually the earlier debug rebuild took 5 min. Let me do it since it's the real verification. But maybe I should just trust the zip test. Hmm. Given the user wants results and the APK release size is the key metric, let me kick off the release build to measure. But it might be very slow (R8 on a huge app). The user aborted it before. \n\nLet me think about whether release build is necessary now. The primary objective is the install fix: release was 87MB with 30MB DEX dictionary; now DEX dictionary removed (~-30MB) and asset added (+~8.8MB) → expected release ~65.8MB. I can compute but not confirm without building.\n\nI'll attempt the release build since it's the crux. But it may take a long time. Let me try with a long timeout and see. Actually, maybe I should first rebuild debug to confirm packaging works with the index + chunks (the asset merge), which is faster than full R8 release? Debug assemble was 5 min. Release with R8 could be 10-20 min. \n\nLet me do the debug rebuild to confirm packaging (and size), since release is riskier/slower. Actually, the debug APK grew before (hash shards). With contiguous chunks it should now be ~debug_baseline + 8.8MB. The earlier debug with single asset was 107.7MB (per my notes). With chunks it'd be ~105MB? Let me just rebuild debug and confirm.\n\nHmm, but I've spent a lot. Let me weigh. The user asked \"ну что там\" then continue. I've made substantial changes. I should verify and report, and ask about remaining issues (2) and (4).\n\nLet me rebuild debug to confirm, then report. I'll run assembleDebug.\n\nActually — a faster packaging check: run only the asset merge task. The task that merges assets into the APK is `:app:mergeDebugAssets` and packaging is `:app:packageDebug`. Let me run `:app:assembleDebug` anyway; it reuses caches mostly.\n\nLet me run it.", "time": {"start": 1791918250043, "end": 1791918254467}, "id": "prt_136a6983b001lE8bGiLuIyoaAG", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a67dd4001yYz75zx8L1WvEc"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Непрерывные чанки сжались в **8.78 МБ** — даже меньше единого файла (11.34 МБ). Пересобираю debug для подтверждения упаковки:", "time": {"start": 1791918254477, "end": 1791918254716}, "id": "prt_136a6a98d001lncnVYoDdsrbnQ", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a67dd4001yYz75zx8L1WvEc"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_00_qpx1viv049771jikzp6z7dja", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug 2>&1 | tail -4 && APK=app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-arm64-v8a-debug.apk && ls -l \"$APK\" | awk '{print \"debug APK:\", $5, \"bytes\"}' && unzip -v \"$APK\" | grep \"assets/ocr/ru_words/\" | awk '{c+=$3; u+=$1} END {print \"shards in APK:\", NR, \"uncompressed=\"u, \"compressed=\"c}' && unzip -l \"$APK\" | grep \"ocr/ru_wordlist\" || echo \"single asset: none (good)\"", "timeout": 1200000}, "output": "\nBUILD SUCCESSFUL in 20s\n263 actionable tasks: 10 executed, 253 up-to-date\nConfiguration cache entry reused.\ndebug APK: 107965955 bytes\nshards in APK: 257 uncompressed=71117004 compressed=11350392\nsingle asset: none (good)\n", "metadata": {"output": "\nBUILD SUCCESSFUL in 20s\n263 actionable tasks: 10 executed, 253 up-to-date\nConfiguration cache entry reused.\ndebug APK: 107965955 bytes\nshards in APK: 257 uncompressed=71117004 compressed=11350392\nsingle asset: none (good)\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug 2>&1 | tail -4 && APK=app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-arm64-v8a-debug.apk && ls -l \"$APK\" | awk '{print \"debug APK:\", $5, \"bytes\"}' && unzip -v \"$APK\" | grep \"assets/ocr/ru_words/\" | awk '{c+=$3; u+=$1} END {print \"shards in APK:\", NR, \"uncompressed=\"u, \"compressed=\"c}' && unzip -l \"$APK\" | grep \"ocr/ru_wordlist\" || echo \"single asset: none (good)\"", "time": {"start": 1791918254709, "end": 1791918275540}}, "id": "prt_136a6a99d001llHiDJYlhAofLo", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a67dd4001yYz75zx8L1WvEc"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 65720, "input": 541, "output": 262, "reasoning": 533, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 64384}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_136a6fc57001IwQ1NXZqReM6SK", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a67dd4001yYz75zx8L1WvEc"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_136851e9f001vbQSM6Hp2bsA9j", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 66778, "input": 903, "output": 158, "reasoning": 821, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 64896}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791918277136, "completed": 1791918289282}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_136a70210001yxff2rZB7SkTxg", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "f21b20664e4c1500fb7c2f6b06d4f4f2b628e438", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_136a7131f001g6xsP1a99ekaGi", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a70210001yxff2rZB7SkTxg"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Hmm! In the actual APK, the shards compressed to 11,350,392 bytes (~11.35 MB), NOT 8.78MB like the zip -9 test. So AGP is using a lower compression level (or different flate). Still, 11.35MB ≈ same as the single file's 11.34MB. Good — no regression vs single file, and locality preserved. The debug APK is now 107,965,955 bytes, which is essentially the same as the 107,767,032 earlier single-asset build (+~200KB for 257 files overhead). \n\nWait, but 257 entries: 256 chunks + index.txt. Compressed 11,350,392 includes index? The grep matches \"assets/ocr/ru_words/\" which includes index.txt. Yes 257. Good.\n\nSo the debug APK size is basically unchanged from the single-file approach (~107.9MB vs 107.7MB). The chunking achieves lazy loading without hurting APK size. \n\nNow, why did the zip test say 8.78MB but APK 11.35MB? Different deflate levels. Doesn't matter; both fine.\n\nSo dictionary work is done and verified:\n- APK packaging works.\n- Tests pass.\n- Lazy chunked loading, no 3M spike.\n\nNow the debug APK grew from... wait, earlier \"app-arm64-v8a-debug.apk = 107,767,032 bytes (103MB)\" with single asset. Now 107,965,955. Basically same. Good.\n\nNow I should compare to the RELEASE build to confirm the install fix (release was 87,103,556). The release removes the 30MB DEX dictionary and adds 11.35MB asset → expected ~68MB. Let me build release to confirm. This is the crux deliverable. Let me attempt it. It could take a while. Given the user aborted before, but the objective requires knowing. Let me try with a 30-min timeout.\n\nActually, before that — let me reconsider remaining issues. I've addressed:\n- Issue 3 (dictionary chunks): DONE.\n- Issue 1 (slow startup): partially — AppModule background init + OCR persist off main. The Migrator runBlocking remains (risky). \n\n- Issue 2 (first OCR call auto-selects models, no chooser): NOT addressed. Needs product decision.\n- Issue 4 (manual region selection rejects frames/speech bubbles): NOT investigated.\n\nI should report status and ask the user how to proceed on 2 and 4, since they're substantial and 2 needs a UX choice. Meanwhile, I can kick off the release build to confirm size.\n\nLet me start the release build in the background? The bash tool is synchronous. I'll run it with a long timeout. If it takes too long, it'll timeout. Let me try.\n\nActually, let me not blindly run a possibly 20-min build. Let me check if there's a release signing config that would fail without a keystore. Earlier the user aborted assembleRelease — maybe it requires signing config / env (RELEASE_TAG). The version comes from RELEASE_TAG env fallback. A release build without signing might still produce an unsigned APK or fail. Let me check app/build.gradle.kts signing config quickly.\n\nGiven uncertainty, let me just try `./gradlew :app:assembleRelease` with a decent timeout and see. If it fails due to signing, I'll report.\n\nHmm, but I should be mindful of time. Let me instead report the current solid progress and ask about the remaining two issues + whether to run the release build (since it's long and they aborted before). Actually the user explicitly wants the install fixed — verifying release size is important.\n\nLet me look at build.gradle.kts signing/release config to decide if assembleRelease will work.", "time": {"start": 1791918281511, "end": 1791918288446}, "id": "prt_136a71327001N16XgEGZBpdEIQ", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a70210001yxff2rZB7SkTxg"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Упаковка подтверждена: 257 чанков в APK, сжато ~11.35 МБ (как единый файл), debug APK 107.97 МБ без регресса. Смотрю release-конфиг, чтобы прикинуть сборку релиза:", "time": {"start": 1791918288450, "end": 1791918289122}, "id": "prt_136a72e42001aAM40g168DOESE", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136a70210001yxff2rZB7SkTxg"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_00_iw1xnasske72vra4s2gi2vsl", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && grep -n \"signingConfig\\|isMinifyEnabled\\|RELEASE_TAG\\|versionName\\|versionCode\\|create(\\\"release\\\")\\|release {\" app/build.gradle.kts | head -40"}, "output": "36:        // RELEASE_TAG, напр. \"v1.9.7\" -> versionName 1.9.7, versionCode 10907).\n38:        val tagVersion = System.getenv(\"RELEASE_TAG\")\n46:        // Android отказывается ставить APK, чей versionCode МЕНЬШЕ уже\n51:        // Поэтому versionCode берётся как максимум из трёх величин:\n60:        versionCode = maxOf(versionFromTag, commitCount, minVersionCode)\n61:        versionName = effectiveVersion\n83:        signingConfigs {\n94:        signingConfigs {\n107:            versionNameSuffix = \"-${getLatestCommitCount()}\"\n111:            isMinifyEnabled = true\n114:            signingConfig = debug.signingConfig\n137:            versionNameSuffix = debug.versionNameSuffix\n146:            versionNameSuffix = \"-benchmark\"\n", "metadata": {"output": "36:        // RELEASE_TAG, напр. \"v1.9.7\" -> versionName 1.9.7, versionCode 10907).\n38:        val tagVersion = System.getenv(\"RELEASE_TAG\")\n46:        // Android отказывается ставить APK, чей versionCode МЕНЬШЕ уже\n51:        // Поэтому versionCode берётся как максимум из трёх величин:\n60:        versionCode = maxOf(versionFromTag, commitCount, minVersionCode)\n61:        versionName = effectiveVersion\n83:        signingConfigs {\n94:        signingConfigs {\n107:            versionNameSuffix = \"-${getLatestCommitCount()}\"\n111:            isMinifyEnabled = true\n114:            signingConfig = debug.signingConfig\n137:            versionNameSuffix = debug.versionNameSuffix\n146:            versionNameSuffix = \"-benchmark\"\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && 